{"_note":"合并首页(appstore-merged §6):hero → [已接入:经营条 · 需要处理 · 我的 App | 未接入:接入行] → 今日动态 → 关注(去掉账号里的 App)→ 榜单 → 加组件 · 设置 → 页脚。生成器 gen_appstore.py。","type":"page","id":"appwatch-home","root":{"type":"container","id":"root","layout":"list","direction":"vertical","gap":"10pt","_notePad":"左右内边距恒 **14pt**(page-design-system.md §5)。上下留白读 `@contentInset`(= @safeArea + 容器 chrome 占位 + 键盘),不是写死的 16pt —— 首页 navStyle=none,容器的 ···/✕ 胶囊**浮在内容之上**,写死留白会让顶部那行正好压在胶囊底下(2026-08-08 iPhone 13 Pro 模拟器实测撞到)。⚠️ 也不能读 `@safeArea`:大屏浮层卡 safeArea 全 0、照样撞上去。","padding":"14pt","paddingTop":"${@contentInset.top}pt","paddingBottom":"24pt","_note":"页面级 depends 取一次:批量 lookup 一发拿全 6 个 App,hero / 动态 / 卡列表共用同一份。","depends":[{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-home.df]","params":{"_cache":1},"_note":"私有面排在前:两条流重名的键(见 appstore-merged §13)由后面的公开流胜出。"},{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/watchlist.df]","params":{"_cache":1,"w":"${@window.width}"},"_note":"\n`w` = 容器宽(v40):展开态商店卡的高随「截图格宽 × 该 App 截图比例」走,格宽随容器宽走,故卡高只能在数据层算(app.df 同款)。\n`_cache:1` = 开首屏缓存(§5.5 / G23)。**开关默认关** —— 这条 `.df` 同时被 `.xwidget` 消费,卡片那边不传这个键,于是永远真取数(卡片的刷新意图就是跳过缓存,数据层再压一层会让整条刷新链路空转)。"}],"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"hero","h":"82pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-hero.rcn]"}},{"_note":"⓪ 经营条(已接入才出现;缺编号 / 没权限等在块里给一句引导)。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"biz","h":"128pt","events":{"onClick":{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-open-sales.af]","params":{"bid":""}}},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-biz.rcn]","depends":[{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-hbiz.df]","params":{}}]},"_note":"经营块 = 自己取数的画布叶子(appstore-merged §13):逐天日报冷启动慢,挂在页面根上会把整页拖进 15s 超时;放在叶子里只影响这一块(失败 / 加载态都在这一格里)。高度固定,非正常态的引导也画在这一块里。"}]},{"_note":"①「需要处理」:被拒 · 待回复 · 新 TestFlight 反馈 · 性能变差,有才画,每条都能点进去;一条都没有时画一行「都正常」(不可点)。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"secTodo","h":"26pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-sec-todo.rcn]"}},{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${rejCnt},0),0),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"tdRej","h":"56pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-todo.rcn]"},"params":{"k":"1","c":"${rejCnt}","t":"${ejN}"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/app?appId=${ejA}&country="}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${pendAll},0),0),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"tdRp","h":"56pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-todo.rcn]"},"params":{"k":"2","c":"${pendAll}","t":"${pdN}"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/reviews?appId=${pdA}&country="}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${fbNew},0),0),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"tdTf","h":"56pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-todo.rcn]"},"params":{"k":"3","c":"${fbNew}","t":"${bapp}"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/app?appId=${fbA}&country="}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${pfBad},0),0),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"tdPf","h":"56pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-todo.rcn]"},"params":{"k":"4","c":"${pfBad}","t":"${heroN}","f1":"${Lb}","f2":"${Hb}","f3":"${Mb}","f4":"${Tb}"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/app?appId=${heroA}&country="}}]},{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(gt::(findNotEmpty::(${nTodo},0),0),0,1)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"tdOk","h":"56pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-todo.rcn]"},"params":{"k":"0"}}]}]},{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),if::(ge::(${mTotal},1),1,0),0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"secApps","h":"26pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-sec-apps.rcn]"}},{"op":"forEach","props":{"items":"${mList}","key":"it","index":"i"},"items":[{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(lt::(${i},${mTotal}),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"app-${i}","h":"58pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-app.rcn]"},"params":{"n":"${it.n}","v":"${it.v}","s":"${it.s}","dl":"${it.dl}","ic":"${it.ic}"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/app?appId=${it.id}&country="}}]}],"_note":"定长 6 槽按 total 截断。`dl` = 锚点日的首次下载(没有销售权限时为空、不画)。"}]},{"_note":"② 配好了密钥但团队下没有 App —— 不是错误,是一句话能说清的状态。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),if::(ge::(${mTotal},1),0,1),0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"empty","h":"90pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-empty.rcn]"}}]},{"_note":"没绑密钥:经营条与「需要处理」合成这一行(§6 首页)。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),0,1)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"connect","h":"56pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-connect.rcn]"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/connect"}}]},{"_note":"今日动态:evCnt≥1 才出现,不画空壳。发版行(k=1)在前、评分变动行(k=2)在后;同一 App 两样都发生只出发版行。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${evCnt},0),1),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"secDyn","h":"28pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-sec-dyn.rcn]"}},{"op":"forEach","props":{"items":"${list}","key":"a","index":"i"},"items":[{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(lt::(${i},${total}),if::(eq::(${a.ev},1),1,0),0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"dyn-${i}","h":"44pt","params":{"k":"1","n":"${a.n}","v":"${a.v}","d":"${a.d}"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/app?appId=${a.id}&country=${cc}"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-dyn.rcn]"}}]}]},{"_note":"评分变动行:tk=1 且当天没发版(nw=0,发过版的那条已在上面说了)。","op":"forEach","props":{"items":"${list}","key":"a","index":"i"},"items":[{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(lt::(${i},${total}),if::(eq::(${a.nw},1),0,if::(eq::(${a.tk},1),1,0)),0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"dynr-${i}","h":"44pt","params":{"k":"2","n":"${a.n}","fr":"${a.fr}","to":"${a.r}"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/app?appId=${a.id}&country=${cc}"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-dyn.rcn]"}}]}]}]},{"_note":"整行可点 → 管理页(增删 / 搜索 / 切地区 / 标「我的 App」)。","type":"Canvas","id":"secMine","h":"28pt","events":{"onClick":"@[file://page/flow/open-manage.af]"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-sec-mine.rcn]"},"params":{"v":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(${total},0)-findNotEmpty::(${amN},0)),findNotEmpty::(${total},0))]"}},{"_note":"第一遍:有动静的卡(big=1,发版或评分变动 → 展开态带截图条 + 高亮描边),天然置顶。v40:卡高 `${a.bh}pt` 由 watchlist.df 逐槽算(截图真比例:竖屏 6.x 吋 ≈ 323 / 5.5 吋 ≈ 282 / 横屏 ≈ 144,iPhone 宽),此前写死 196 → 104pt 见方的格子把竖屏截图裁得只剩中间三分之一。`op:if` 的 cond 用 `$[if::(…,1,0)]` 兜成 1/0 —— evalBool 只认 boolean / 数字非零 / 字符串 \"true\"|\"1\"。","op":"forEach","props":{"items":"${list}","key":"a","index":"i"},"items":[{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(${ok},1),index::(${AM},${i}),0),1),0,if::(lt::(${i},${total}),if::(eq::(${a.big},1),1,0),0))]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"big-${i}","h":"${a.bh}pt","params":{"n":"${a.n}","ic":"${a.ic}","v":"${a.v}","r":"${a.r}","st":"${a.st}","cf":"${a.cf}","d":"${a.d}","nt":"${a.nt}","u1":"${a.u1}","u2":"${a.u2}","u3":"${a.u3}","tk":"${a.tk}","du":"${a.du}","dl":"${a.dl}","nw":"${a.nw}","dy":"${a.dy}"},"events":{"_note":"只带 appId + country 两个键。App 名不进 query(名字里带空格/& 的一堆);country 必须带:首页看的是 CN 的评分,点进去不能变成 US。","onClick":"numable://self/page/app?appId=${a.id}&country=${cc}"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-card-big.rcn]"}}]}]},{"_note":"第二遍:列表前两张(i<2)没事件也用展开态 —— 设计稿定的「有事件的卡 + 前两张展开截图条」,没有当日事件的常态里首页也要有商店卡的脸(2026-09-02 用户对照设计稿点出)。nw/tk 照传:无事件时 NEW 不亮、chip 灰、右角按 tk 显 delta 或日期。","op":"forEach","props":{"items":"${list}","key":"a","index":"i"},"items":[{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(${ok},1),index::(${AM},${i}),0),1),0,if::(lt::(${i},${total}),if::(eq::(${a.big},1),0,if::(lt::(${i},2),1,0)),0))]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"show-${i}","h":"${a.bh}pt","params":{"n":"${a.n}","ic":"${a.ic}","v":"${a.v}","r":"${a.r}","st":"${a.st}","cf":"${a.cf}","d":"${a.d}","nt":"${a.nt}","u1":"${a.u1}","u2":"${a.u2}","u3":"${a.u3}","tk":"${a.tk}","du":"${a.du}","dl":"${a.dl}","nw":"${a.nw}","dy":"${a.dy}"},"events":{"_note":"只带 appId + country 两个键。App 名不进 query(名字里带空格/& 的一堆);country 必须带:首页看的是 CN 的评分,点进去不能变成 US。","onClick":"numable://self/page/app?appId=${a.id}&country=${cc}"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-card-big.rcn]"}}]}]},{"_note":"第三遍:第 3 张起且没动静的卡(紧凑态)。","op":"forEach","props":{"items":"${list}","key":"a","index":"i"},"items":[{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(${ok},1),index::(${AM},${i}),0),1),0,if::(lt::(${i},${total}),if::(eq::(${a.big},1),0,if::(lt::(${i},2),0,1)),0))]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"app-${i}","h":"84pt","params":{"n":"${a.n}","ic":"${a.ic}","v":"${a.v}","r":"${a.r}","st":"${a.st}","cf":"${a.cf}","d":"${a.d}","nt":"${a.nt}","tk":"${a.tk}","du":"${a.du}","dl":"${a.dl}","dy":"${a.dy}"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/app?appId=${a.id}&country=${cc}"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-card.rcn]"}}]}]},{"_note":"空态(含取数失败取不到 total 那轮)= 引导入口而非空白。","op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(ge::(findNotEmpty::(${total},0),1),0,1)]"},"items":[{"_noteH":"⚠️ 168pt 是**量出来的**,不是拍的:p-empty.rcn 的文案按最窄容器(≈288pt 内容宽,鸿蒙折叠屏外屏/小屏 Android)排版,ink 底落在 152.5pt,+16pt 下留白。改那张卡的任何一句文案都要重量一次(tools/rcnrender 渲一张、扫 ink 底),两处一起改 —— RCN 不会把内容撑开,矮了就把「做完能得到什么」那几句截掉,而那正是这一屏唯一的说服力。","type":"Canvas","id":"empty","h":"168pt","events":{"onClick":"@[file://page/flow/open-manage.af]"},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-empty.rcn]"}}]},{"_note":"免费榜分类切换:一颗 chip = 一个 Canvas,点了走 set-genre.af(记 data.chartGenre 再软重载)。高亮读根流透出的 chartG。","type":"container","id":"genres","layout":"flex","direction":"horizontal","gap":"6pt","h":"28pt","items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"g-all","w":"${chipW}pt","h":"28pt","params":{"g":""},"events":{"onClick":{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/set-genre.af]","params":{"g":""}}},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-chip.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"g-6014","w":"${chipW}pt","h":"28pt","params":{"g":"6014"},"events":{"onClick":{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/set-genre.af]","params":{"g":"6014"}}},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-chip.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"g-6007","w":"${chipW}pt","h":"28pt","params":{"g":"6007"},"events":{"onClick":{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/set-genre.af]","params":{"g":"6007"}}},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-chip.rcn]"}},{"type":"Canvas","id":"g-6005","w":"${chipW}pt","h":"28pt","params":{"g":"6005"},"events":{"onClick":{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/set-genre.af]","params":{"g":"6005"}}},"canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-chip.rcn]"}}]},{"_note":"免费榜块(与 topfree 组件同一份流)。没关注任何 App 的新用户首页也有东西可看。page=1 → 流从 data.chartGenre 读分类。","type":"Canvas","id":"topfree","h":"354pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-topfree.rcn]","depends":[{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/topfree.df]","params":{"page":1}}]}},{"_note":"加卡入口 = **一个按钮**(§8.1a)。`watchlist` 不需要先选对象,故挂首页;`rating`/`version`/`regions` 三张卡吃 appId,挂 app 详情页。","type":"Canvas","id":"addBtn","h":"56pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-addbtn.rcn]"},"events":{"onClick":{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/pick-home.af]","params":{}}}},{"op":"if","props":{"cond":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),1,0)]"},"items":[{"type":"Canvas","id":"settings","h":"56pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/m-p-set.rcn]"},"events":{"onClick":"numable://self/page/settings"}}]},{"type":"Canvas","id":"foot","h":"74pt","canvas":{"source":"@[file://page/rc/p-foot.rcn]"}}],"events":{"_note":"onLoad:两条 G23 流各自校新。onRefresh:一次删两边的当前缓存键再 reloadPage。onVisible:凭证态自愈(绑定状态与渲染时不一致才重载)。","onLoad":[{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/revalidate.af]","params":{"stale":"${_stale}","ckey":"${ckey}"}},{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-home-revalidate.af]","params":{"stale":"${m_stale}","ckey":"${mckey}"}}],"onRefresh":"@[file://page/flow/refresh-home.af]","onVisible":[{"flow":"@[file://page/flow/m-cred-recheck.af]","params":{"cs":"${csB}"}}]}}}
